<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michalis V - 30,000 tonnes urea Yuzhnyy/WC India $32 fio 6,000/1,200 option JNPT $29 2,500 discharge or Kandla $31 1,500 discharge 17-23/4 Indian Government.</p>
<p>Rosaleen - 14,000 tones urea Umm Said/India $11.75 fio 4,500/1,200 13-18/4 Indian Government.</p>
<p>Dubai Valour - 12,000 tones urea Umm Said/India $11.75 fio 4,500/1,200 16-28/4 Indian Government.</p>
</text>
